{#-
  The owner saying something in the Suggestions chat (suggestions/chat.ts): the page first when
  it has changed since Procreator last saw it, which is the long context; then whether its last
  list was approved; then the owner's words, last. Takes the page as text ('' when it hasn't
  changed), approved, and the owner's text.
-#}
{% if page %}
<page>
{{ page }}
</page>

{% endif %}
{% if approved %}
The owner approved your last list, and it's on the page now.

{% endif %}
<owner>
{{ text }}
</owner>
